      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a good start for the outline. Can you write out the section where I address the counter-argument about meritocracy? I want to make sure I effectively show why the \"merit-based\" argument is basically irrelevant or flawed when you consider all the systemic stuff you mentioned earlier. How should I frame it so it doesn't undermine my main point?",
